# This file exists so that the `docs/` directory is committed to git.
#
# MkDocs validates that `docs_dir` exists *before* any hook runs, so we
# need this folder to be present at checkout time. The actual content
# (everything else in this directory) is generated on every build by
# `hooks/prepare_docs.py` and is gitignored. Don't add anything here
# by hand — edit the source files at the repo root instead.
